{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">OS-DRIVES function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310215","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/OS-DRIVES-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/OS-DRIVES-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">OS-DRIVES function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p osrestrict\">(Windows only)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns\na comma-separated list of available drives. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function__syntax_GC19YK2698664\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d51435e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function__idGDN2OU2673695\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>OS-DRIVES</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function__example_GC19YL2698668\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d51435e125\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing procedure populates a selection list with the output of\nthe OS-DRIVES function, and then displays the list and prompts the\nuser to select a drive. The procedure then informs the user that\nsubsequent writes will be to the selected drive.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-os-drv.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function__idGDN2OV2673699\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE drives AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO LABEL &quot;Select a Drive&quot;\n  VIEW-AS SELECTION-LIST INNER-CHARS 3 INNER-LINES 5.\n\nDEFINE FRAME f\n  drives.\n\ndrives:LIST-ITEMS = <strong class=\"ph b\">OS-DRIVES.</strong>\nUPDATE drives WITH FRAME f.\nMESSAGE &quot;Files will be written to drive&quot; INPUT drives:SCREEN-VALUE.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"OS-DRIVES-function__notes_GC19YM2698674\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d51435e163\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">On platforms\nother than Windows, OS-DRIVES compiles and executes, but returns\nthe empty string (&quot;&quot;).</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OS-DELETE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OS-DELETE-statement.html\">OS-DELETE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OS-ERROR-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OS-ERROR-function.html\">OS-ERROR function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310215","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"OS-DRIVES function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OS-DRIVES-function.html","type":"Manual"}